# What generates Source/TargetFilter/Generated: read by regenerate.sh, by the filter-parser CI job and by the
# setup-dotnet step of that job. Move the commit only to a commit of the DotGram repository whose CI is green, in a
# commit of its own together with the regenerated folder.
#
# commit  the DotGram commit whose DotGram.Cli generates the parser (the tool's version string does not tell commits apart)
# sdk     the exact .NET SDK the generation runs with: the generated text includes the compiler's own text of the
#         embedded attribute, so another SDK may write different bytes
commit=2adfb25704001eeded51e1cebb9570d77421e3a9
sdk=10.0.401
